   "summary": "This study measured the taxonomic composition and diversity of Chironomidae (specifically head capsules) collected from 44 surface samples across different habitats, comparing the community composition between Sphagnum hummocks and other sites. The study measured the relative abundance and frequency of various chironomid taxa across five different wetland habitats (hummock, hollow, ditch, pond, and pool)."
